---
const basePath = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<section class="relative -mt-[72px] sm:-mt-[76px] min-h-[820px] sm:min-h-[900px] lg:min-h-[max(66.7vw,760px)] overflow-hidden bg-[#FAF9F2]">
  <img
    src={`${basePath}/assets/hero-hill.jpg`}
    alt="A woman and a small robot sitting together on a grassy hill, working on one laptop"
    class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 w-full h-[58%] sm:h-full object-cover object-[28%_100%] sm:object-[center_bottom] select-none"
    fetchpriority="high"
  />
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[62%] sm:h-[50%] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FAF9F2] via-[#FAF9F2]/70 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-5 pt-[116px] sm:pt-[140px] lg:pt-[150px] text-center">
    <h1 class="mx-auto max-w-[1040px] text-[40px] leading-[1.06] sm:text-[56px] lg:text-[66px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-ink">
      Every agent step at the
      <span class="inline-flex align-middle items-center justify-center w-[0.9em] h-[0.9em] -mt-[0.12em] mx-[0.04em] rounded-full bg-ink text-white">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-[0.48em] h-[0.48em]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h11l-3-3M20 17H9l3 3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </span>
      <span class="font-light italic text-ink-secondary">right price</span>,
      <br class="hidden sm:block" />
      inside its spending cap.
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-5 mx-auto max-w-[620px] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-secondary">
      EcoRouter is a unified resource router for agentic inference. Each model call, search and scrape goes to the provider with the best live price and speed, and gets rerouted the moment a budget or latency target changes.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="#router" class="pill-cta h-12 text-[15px]">
        Try the router
        <span class="pill-cta-dot w-9 h-9" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M5 11L11 5M6 5h5v5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
      </a>
      <a href="#how" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 h-12 px-5 rounded-full bg-white/70 backdrop-blur border border-white text-[15px] text-ink hover:bg-white transition-colors">
        How it works
        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="w-3 h-3" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3.5v9l7-4.5z"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[13px] text-ink-muted">Built for the Airwallex Agentic Banking Hackathon · Inference Sourcing track · Airwallex settlement in progress</p>
  </div>
</section>
